# M2M Tor configuration for the hardened image.
# Client-only: SocksPort for optional SOCKS5 use, no relays, no control.
SocksPort 9050
SafeLogging 1
Log notice syslog
ClientOnly 1
# Refuse plaintext risky exits? Tor handles circuit isolation per app.
ExitPolicy reject *:*   # belt-and-braces; client only anyway
